tools/, start.command) and documentation. The following files keep their own
licenses:

songs/*.mp3 and songs/*.txt (music recordings and lyrics)
  From the JamendoLyrics dataset (https://github.com/f90/jamendolyrics), each
  under its Creative Commons license (https://www.jamendo.com):
    - "Feel (Stripped)" by Cortéz — CC BY
      https://www.jamendo.com/track/1481500
    - "Is It Right?" by Lower Loveday — CC BY-SA
      https://www.jamendo.com/track/1559614
    - "Bad Side" by Rxbyn — CC BY
      https://www.jamendo.com/track/1556580

songs/*.csv (word timings)
  From the JamendoLyrics dataset, MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2023 Daniel Stoller, Simon Durand, Sebastian Ewert.

songs/*.pitch.json (vocal pitch tracks)
  Derived from the recordings above; distributed under the same license as
  the corresponding song.

